VF-T007: value out of range
Phase: semantic
Location: line 7, column 5
Found: 11
Expected: 5..10
Hint:
A constant value assigned to a range subtype must lie within the declared bounds.

Example:
    type Percent is Integer range 0..100
    let x: Percent = 50 -- OK
    let y: Percent = 150 -- Error: 150 out of range
